  "Proposals": "申请",
  "Create or link a secret here, then open an agent's Environment variables or a project's Env field. Add the env key the process expects, for example": "在这里创建或关联密钥，然后打开智能体的“环境变量”或项目的“环境变量”。添加程序需要的变量名，例如",
  ", choose": "，选择",
  ", and select the stored secret version.": "，再选择已保存的密钥版本。",
  "Secret": "密钥",
  "choose": "选择",
  "and select the stored secret version.": "并选择已保存的密钥版本。",
  "Paperclip resolves the value server-side when the run starts and injects it as that env var. Project env applies to every task in the project and overrides agent env on matching keys.": "运行开始时，Paperclip 会在服务端解密密钥，并将其注入指定环境变量。项目环境变量作用于该项目的每项任务；与智能体变量同名时，项目设置优先。",
  "Experimental features": "实验功能",
  "Experimental features may break at any time.": "实验功能可能随时失效。",
  "These features are opt-in and come with no compatibility guarantees. They may change, break, or be removed without notice. Avoid relying on them for critical or production workflows.": "这些功能需主动开启，不保证兼容性，可能未经通知即变更、失效或移除。请勿将其用于关键或正式工作流程。",
  "Experimental features may break at any time. These features are opt-in and come with no compatibility guarantees. They may change, break, or be removed without notice. Avoid relying on them for critical or production workflows.": "实验功能可能随时变更、中断或移除，且不保证兼容性。请勿将其用于关键或正式工作流程。",
  "Optional product features that are still being evaluated.": "仍在评估中的可选产品功能。",
  "Beta skills": "测试版技能",
  "Allow agents to pin beta releases of the Paperclip core skill. Disabling this returns every agent to the default live skill without removing saved pins.": "允许智能体固定使用 Paperclip 核心技能的测试版。关闭后会恢复默认正式版，但保留已保存的版本设置。",
  "Built-in Agents": "内置智能体",
  "Show Paperclip-managed built-in agent surfaces, including built-in roster badges, the Built-in agents tab, and built-in agent setup controls.": "显示由 Paperclip 管理的内置智能体，包括成员标识、内置智能体标签页和设置项。",
  "Durable work products (blog posts, tweet storms…) that tasks create and iterate on. Adds the Cases tab and the agent case API.": "启用可持续修改的任务成果（如文章和推文合集），并显示“案例”标签页及智能体案例接口。",
  "Turning Cases off hides the tab and blocks the case API; existing case data is kept.": "关闭案例功能会隐藏标签页并停用接口；已有案例数据保留。",
  "Agent Chat": "智能体对话",
  "Talk to each agent in one ongoing conversation. Clarify goals and create tasks for execution.": "与每个智能体保持持续对话，澄清目标并创建执行任务。",
  "Turning this off preserves conversations and lets active runs finish, but prevents new messages.": "关闭后保留既有对话，并允许当前运行结束，但无法发送新消息。",
  "Chat connectors": "聊天连接器",
  "Connect agents to Slack, GitHub, Discord, Microsoft Teams, and Telegram conversations.": "让智能体接入 Slack、GitHub、Discord、Microsoft Teams 和 Telegram 对话。",
  "Turning this off hides chat setup, channels, and connected-task controls. Existing chat connections keep running. GitHub and other tool connectors stay available.": "关闭后隐藏聊天设置、频道和关联任务控件。已有聊天连接继续运行，GitHub 等工具连接器仍可用。",
  "Show the Decisions item in the main sidebar — the attention home that surfaces the tasks awaiting your input — while the surface is still being evaluated.": "在主侧栏显示“待决事项”，集中查看等待你处理的任务。",
  "Enable Environments": "启用运行环境",
  "Enable External Objects": "启用外部对象",
  "Detect external URLs in issues and show resolved status for pull requests, tickets, and other referenced work objects.": "识别任务中的外部链接，并显示关联的拉取请求、工单等事项的处理状态。",
  "Enable Isolated Workspaces": "启用隔离工作区",
  "Show execution workspace controls in project configuration and allow isolated workspace behavior for new and existing task runs.": "在项目设置中显示执行工作区控件，并允许新旧任务使用隔离工作区。",
  "Experimental File Viewer": "实验性文件查看器",
  "Show task detail controls for browsing and previewing workspace files relative to a task.": "在任务详情中浏览和预览该任务工作区内的文件。",
  "Allow new Codex agents to select the experimental Rust Paperclip Runner, including authenticated runner ingress when a sandbox requires it. Onboarding continues to use legacy adapters. Turning this off hides the choice without affecting existing native runs.": "允许新建 Codex 智能体选择实验性的 Rust Paperclip Runner。关闭后仅隐藏此选项，不影响已有运行。",
  "Simplified English Interactions": "简化英语交互",
  "Instruct agents to write user interactions (plan confirmations, questions, suggested tasks, checkbox prompts) in ASD-STE100 Simplified Technical English, with brief context on what information the decision needs and what happens for each choice.": "要求智能体使用 ASD-STE100 简化技术英语编写确认、提问和选项，并简述每个选项的影响。",
  "First task: propose with a plan document": "首项任务：先提交计划文档",
  "When the user's first request is a single task, the chief of staff writes a short plan document and a checkbox card instead of a one-card confirmation. Applies to organizations created after the toggle is flipped.": "当用户的首个请求只有一项任务时，办公室协调员会先提交简短计划文档和选择卡片。仅适用于开启后新建的组织。",
  "Status Cards": "状态卡片",
  "Enable the experimental shared status-card board and its gated API. Existing card data is kept when this is disabled.": "启用实验性共享状态卡片看板及接口。关闭后已有卡片数据仍保留。",
  "Enabling Status Cards also enables Summaries.": "启用状态卡片也会启用摘要。",
  "Streamlined UI": "精简界面",
  "Use the simplified main sidebar, shared Tasks and Inbox presentation, focused task detail layout, and contextual navigation across Agents, Routines, Skills, and Settings.": "启用精简主侧栏、统一的任务与收件箱视图、聚焦的任务详情布局，以及智能体、例行任务、技能和设置之间的快捷导航。",
  "Turning this off restores the legacy shell and navigation. Task and page data are unchanged.": "关闭后恢复旧版界面与导航，任务和页面数据保持不变。",
  "Summaries": "摘要",
  "Show Summarizer-generated status slots on project and workspace pages, with on-demand refresh and revision history. Existing summary data is kept when this is disabled.": "在项目和工作区页面显示摘要智能体生成的状态，可按需刷新并查看版本历史。关闭后保留既有摘要数据。",
  "Status Cards requires Summaries. Disabling Summaries also disables Status Cards.": "状态卡片依赖摘要；关闭摘要也会关闭状态卡片。",
  "Paperclip Developer Mode": "Paperclip 开发者模式",
  "Internal tools for developing, testing, and debugging Paperclip.": "用于开发、测试和调试 Paperclip 的内部工具。",
  "Show internal Paperclip maintainer tools and observability links, including Honeycomb trace queries on run pages.": "显示 Paperclip 维护工具与可观测性链接，包括运行页面中的 Honeycomb 链路查询。",
  "Managed Environment Only": "仅使用托管运行环境",
  "Hide the local environment and run all agents in the platform-managed environment.": "隐藏本机环境，所有智能体仅在平台托管环境运行。",
  "Server Info Debug View": "服务器信息调试视图",
  "Show a \"Server\" section in the account drawer with the current server restart time and running commit.": "在账号面板中显示“服务器”信息，包括最近重启时间和当前提交。",
  "Smoke Lab": "冒烟测试实验室",
  "Add a \"Smoke Lab\" tab under Apps → Developer and an \"Integration smoke\" card on the dashboard for exercising every integration path against deterministic local fixtures (fake OAuth provider + loopback MCP servers). Private (non-public) deployments only.": "在应用开发者页面添加冒烟测试标签，并在仪表盘显示集成测试卡片，使用本机固定样本验证连接流程。仅供非公开部署使用。",
  "Task Plan Decomposition": "任务计划拆解",
  "Show accepted-plan decomposition history on task detail pages. Intended for debugging and validating subtask creation behavior while the presentation is still being refined.": "在任务详情中显示已接受计划的拆解历史，用于调试和验证子任务创建。",
  "Legacy": "旧版功能",
  "These features are going to be removed.": "这些功能计划移除。",
  "Classic Task Interface": "经典任务界面",
  "Restores the previous task detail page: the page-level header with inline description editing, the plain comment thread, and the fixed Properties sidebar. Chat-only features — streaming activity folding, inline plan and question cards, the three-mode composer — are unavailable in the classic view.": "恢复旧版任务详情：可直接编辑描述的页头、普通评论列表和固定属性侧栏。经典视图不提供聊天视图专属功能。",
  "Switching takes effect immediately. No task data is affected.": "切换后立即生效，不影响任务数据。",
  "Goals Sidebar Link": "侧栏目标入口",
  "Restore the Goals item in the main sidebar while the goals surface is being evaluated.": "在目标功能仍处于评估阶段时，恢复主侧栏的目标入口。",
